--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is an independent set of tooling and documentation. It is
NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or a fork of the Manim Community project
or 3Blue1Brown / Grant Sanderson.

It does not vendor any upstream source code. `manimx/` calls and patches the
Manim package installed at runtime; nothing is copied in.

Two artifacts derive from upstream projects, both MIT-licensed:

* `api/` — generated by reflection (`bin/mx api-dump`) over the *installed*
  packages. It contains public symbol names, signatures, and the first line
  of each docstring from:
    - Manim Community Edition — Copyright (c) 2020-2026 The Manim Community
      Developers — MIT License — https://github.com/ManimCommunity/manim
    - ManimGL — Copyright (c) 2018-2026 3Blue1Brown LLC — MIT License —
      https://github.com/3b1b/manim
  Regenerating it on your machine reproduces it from your own installation.

* `custom_config.yml` — a trimmed, re-commented derivative of
  `manimlib/default_config.yml` from ManimGL (MIT, 3Blue1Brown LLC).

Manim itself is not distributed here; `bin/setup` installs it from PyPI.
Note that the PyAV wheel installed into `.venv/` bundles an FFmpeg build
which may include GPL-licensed encoders (libx264/libx265). That wheel is a
runtime dependency fetched by the user and is not redistributed by this
repository.
